I propose that we develop the world within the narrative, as having to read
through descriptions is hard on the reader; it is also unlikely that we will
remember that the reader does not know anything about the world before
reading the story. Therefore, let's not talk about the world design outside
of the narrative, and simply build on the reality provided in others' text.

